Resonans is published by KlangHaus, the trading name of Asp Productions ApS
(Danish CVR 36708077). The copyright is held by the authors of the work.

That wording is deliberate and it replaced a stronger claim that was measured
untrue. An earlier version of this file said Asp Productions ApS held the
copyright. Under Danish law an employer acquires copyright in software written by
an EMPLOYEE (Ophavsretsloven § 59) — and nobody is employed by the company, so
§ 59 transfers nothing and the rights sit with the individual authors. Measured by
[jura], 2026-09-28.

Consolidating those rights in Asp Productions ApS is intended and is a separate
legal step that has not happened. Until it has, this file says who holds the
copyright rather than who we would like to hold it, because a notice cannot be
withdrawn from a fork.
